{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB新聞主播余浩宗（Cyrus）2016年因報道新聞時眼紅紅，引起觀眾留意，離巢後擺脫以往書生形象，突然留鬚兼狂操肌。</p><p>近年他轉行做歐洲名牌代購生意，生活質素大幅提升，忽然變得超級富貴。</p><p>日前余浩宗拍片瘋狂開箱過萬美元的名牌新袋，平時又經常</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T14:26:23.460770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T14:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:19:36.136316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T14:19:36.136316+00:00","content_hash":"b0879852e6e9f5890f64db8824d0b7a896e3832b10eee8c0cca7911d4fd6a339","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}